Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on...?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.58,0:00:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jeez, why didn't you wake me up sooner?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to make your lunch.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, that ship has sailed...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.38,0:00:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen my underwear?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.25,0:00:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Elfuda-san!\NPlease put on some clothes!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.79,0:00:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Elfuda-san"?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.29,0:00:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are we, business associates?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.79,0:00:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just call me El like you normally do.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.17,0:00:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're acting strange.\NAre you running a fever?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,K..Kuroeda-san! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't feel warm to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.63,0:00:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Also... my name's Khloe.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up or else\Nwe'll be late for school.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Calorie Lovers"!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.46,0:02:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I swear, this morning has been\Nfull of surprises...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.50,0:02:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a minute there,\NI thought you'd forgotten all about us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't get enough sleep?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.88,0:02:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We promised your mom
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.13,0:02:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,we'd keep an eye on you\Nwhile she's away for work, remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.25,0:02:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But crawling into my bed is a bit much...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.58,0:02:22.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we just don't want you\Nto catch a cold, Tomo-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.38,0:02:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you get sick while we're house-sitting,\Nyour mother will be upset with us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we're not kids anymore...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.83,0:02:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ooh, you feeling frisky?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.21,0:02:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what...?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, don't be gross.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.54,0:02:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to start acting\Nall shy around us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've been friends since kindergarten.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get that, but-
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.33,0:02:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since kindergarten...?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.25,0:02:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just... feel a little off today.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,G'morning!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't do that!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.17,Q6,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.17,0:02:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good morning, ladies.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.38,0:03:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Ladies"? Why so formal?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's weird hearing you\Ntalk like that, Tomo-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.04,0:03:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, gotcha...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-kun, you're so funny.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're late! We're late!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.92,0:03:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,C-can't stop now!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Outta the way!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop looking up our skirts!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.58,0:03:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a second... Tomo-kun, is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.29,0:03:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you\Nto watch where you're walking?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.38,0:03:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate, it looks like\Nthe kindergarten gang's all here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's like... an entire class...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.67,0:03:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Speakin' of which,\Nthe two of you totally cheated!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gulp...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't give us that "gulp" nonsense!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.92,0:03:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today was supposed to be the day we decide\Nwho's staying at Tomo-chan's place...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that you live\Nin the same neighborhood!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.33,0:03:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what she said!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna sleep with Tomo-kun, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.17,0:04:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And me...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.25,0:04:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calm down, ladies-
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.21,0:04:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crap, we're late!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.75,0:04:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.88,0:04:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So sleepy...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.46,0:04:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.79,0:04:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I looked away for like five seconds!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.25,0:04:25.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's kind of hypocritical, don't you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what she said!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the one who went\Nbreakin' the rules first!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.63,0:04:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone gets equal time with Tomo-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.88,0:04:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the rule!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are they hovering around my desk...?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.63,0:04:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Knock it off and go sit down, all of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.71,0:04:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei's going to be here any minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're bothering Tomo-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.46,0:04:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-no problem.\NIt's my job as class president.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Oeda-sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.79,0:04:59.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Morning, Tomo-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-good morning...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.04,0:05:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, why don't we skip straight to\Nhomeroom, just you and me?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's inappropriate, Auntie!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.63,0:05:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Preying on innocent students?!\NWhat's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.83,0:05:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't get to walk to school\Nwith Tomo-kun,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I'm entitled to make up for lost time.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.67,0:05:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we aren't spending\Nany one-on-one time with him!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.75,0:05:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sh-she's got a point!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.21,0:05:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,The rest of us are waiting our turn!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is an abuse of power!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.50,0:05:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.88,0:05:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be getting ready\Nfor first period to start!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.21,0:05:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Tomo-kun...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew, it's been a long day...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.79,0:05:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why's everyone so obsessed with me...?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-my bad! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.00,0:05:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want you catching a cold.\NYou can wear my jacket.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It might smell kind of bad though.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.25,0:06:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.33,0:06:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think it smells bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It smells like you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,SERIOUSLY?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This hottie looks good all wet, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.13,0:06:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,See-through!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.88,0:06:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-kun, I get to borrow\Nyour jacket too, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.96,0:06:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-and me...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.42,0:06:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're acting weird...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.79,0:06:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There, there... Good doggie.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.58,0:06:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have more, so there's\Nno need to scarf it down.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.71,0:06:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got a soft side, Miss President.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,T..Tomo-kun?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.00,0:06:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feeding a stray puppy, I mean.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-not really...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.88,0:06:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It just reminded me of you,\Nall uncoordinated and awkward...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.42,0:06:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then do I get a treat, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.17,0:06:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure. Here, want a piece of jerky?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.54,0:06:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mhm, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.29,0:06:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,T..Tomo-kun...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss President?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.46,0:07:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,HEY! What are you two\Nsneaking around back there for?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something's definitely not right...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.50,0:07:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why not eat in the counseling office?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.63,0:07:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because he's eating with me\Non the rooftop today.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.08,0:07:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh? But that's supposed to be my job.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Open wide and I'll feed you!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.42,0:07:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-that's not fair! What about me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.29,0:07:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.13,0:07:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-kun...?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.13,0:07:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's the matter?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.13,0:07:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This whole situation seems\NWAY too good to be true...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.96,0:07:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are all of you so hell-bent on\Nbeing alone with me anyway?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-kun, what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.83,0:07:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You already know the answer to that!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.92,0:07:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's because we're all in love with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.29,0:07:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Love!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.25,0:07:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What kind of a reaction is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're behaving strangely today.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.67,0:07:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten your promise, have you?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, promise...?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.08,0:08:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The promise you made when we were kids!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.54,0:08:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You said you'd marry whichever one of us\Npudgy girls was your favorite!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.38,0:08:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I said that...?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.71,0:08:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Don't act like you're not\NMr. Chubby Chaser!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.38,0:08:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-kun...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.71,0:08:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Surely you aren't trying to\Nweasel your way out
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.42,0:08:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,by pretending to forget just because\Nyou're inconvenienced by us...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on! I swear I didn't-
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.29,0:08:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on! I swear I didn't-
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.29,0:08:26.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,So THAT'S your game...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.21,0:08:26.92,Q6,,0,0,0,,So THAT'S your game...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.13,0:08:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's too late to go back on your word...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.21,0:08:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,FREEZE-
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.25,0:08:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,-suckers!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomo-kun is betrothed to his mommy!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.54,0:08:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.13,0:08:42.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,He proposed to me with a flower\Nwhen he was just a tiny thing!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parents aren't allowed to marry\Ntheir own children!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.21,0:08:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What happened to your business trip...?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And why'd you bust in through the window...?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me!\NWe need to evacuate, quickly!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Evacuate...?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,While you were busy starring in\Na romantic comedy,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.50,0:08:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,something terrible happened\Nto the rest of the world!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.13,0:09:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on down there?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are they EATING people?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.21,0:09:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,A new diet supplement\Nappeared on the market recently...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyone who takes the supplement\Nto lose weight...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calories...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calories...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.63,0:09:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,...turns into a zombie!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calories...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fats...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.29,0:09:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fats...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.33,0:09:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Carbs...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fats...! Carbs...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,CALORIES...!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.63,0:09:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,HEEEEELP!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.17,0:09:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What in the world...?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.96,0:09:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calories...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.29,0:09:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's odd. Why's he having a nightmare?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to move straight into
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,the "fat and happy" stage\Nright after the harem plot twist...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.33,0:09:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Targeting the human again?\NHaven't you learned your lesson?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dark elf?! What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Disguising your spell was clever,\NI'll admit.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.38,0:10:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,\NI'm not falling for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,So YOU did this...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.50,Q6,,0,0,0,,Calories...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.50,0:10:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already called dibs on the human!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.25,0:10:14.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,If the human gets fat, he'll be\Ntoo worried about his own health
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.50,0:10:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,to focus on keeping the rest of us in line.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.33,0:10:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, talk about a selfish attitude!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if you INSIST on getting in my way...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.33,0:10:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.58,0:10:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You walked right into the magical trap I set!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.04,0:10:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crap-!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.46,0:10:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Imagine!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.13,0:10:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,A counter-nightmare?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.21,0:10:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,A mana explosion?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.38,0:10:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,NOOOOO!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hell happened...?
